        height: 30
    - id: 2
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: '"I''m requesting information related to my confinement. That''s a
          protected right. If there''s any delay or obstruction, I''ll need the reason
          documented."'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 6
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 6
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You state clearly that RFIs are how people who are incarcerated protect
          themselves. Without them, rights exist only on paper. You're not asking
          permission --you're asking for the form. \n\nHe looks at the clock. \n\n\"I've
          got a kid who thinks I don't want to be home. And a supervisor who thinks
          paperwork solves everything. So let's not pretend this is personal.\" \n\nHe
          walks toward the RFI paper on the desk in the common room. \"This form
          is how you ask. It's not how you argue. You fill it out wrong, it gets
          kicked back. You fill it out vague, it goes nowhere. You don't get a response,
          that's a response.\"\n\nHe pushes a pen across the desk."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 24
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 24
        originDialogueID: 2
        destinationConversationID: 24
        destinationDialogueID: 11
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 508.38086
        y: 654.38086
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: I don't want to cause any trouble, I just need to understand the rules
          and do things the right way.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 6
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 6
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'CO leans back against the desk, arms crossed. The posture is tired.


          "Ahh,
          so you want a cop-out"


          CO looks at watch. "Most people don''t
          ask for that on their first day."'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
