      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "SHADOW: Isolation builds, stress meter rises. \n\nLIL WINDOW: Over
          time, your patience pays off, the peer support group meets, and while it\u2019s
          awkward, you\u2019re able to both sign and write. This time, people listen."
        type: 0
