      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "C'mon, you have to had done something...\n\n\n[[Being trans in prison
          means you don\u2019t just do time \u2014 you get studied.\n\nAt intake,
          they ask the questions. Are you transgender? Have you been assaulted before?
          Do you think you\u2019re at risk? You can feel the room shift when you
          answer. From that point on, you\u2019re not just a person \u2014 you\u2019re
          a category.\n\nIn population, you\u2019re always aware of yourself. How
          you walk. How you talk. Who\u2019s watching. Some people leave you alone.
          Some don\u2019t. Staff might use the wrong name like it\u2019s nothing.
          Medical care turns into paperwork and waiting and hoping someone believes
          you.\n\nIf they decide you\u2019re \u201Ctoo vulnerable,\u201D they move
          you for \u201Cprotection.\u201D That usually means isolation. A locked
          door is still a locked door, even if they say it\u2019s for your own good.\n\nYou
          learn to calculate everything. Who\u2019s safe. When to correct someone.
          When to let it go. You get good at shrinking, or at standing still.\n\nMostly,
          it\u2019s exhausting.\nTrying to survive.\nTrying not to disappear.]]"
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 3c52120b-ee8c-45e5-adff-a67413d5ae45
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 29
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
