    - id: 14
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: Why? What good can all that legalese do?
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "What good can it do?\n\nIt\u2019s not about the fancy words.\n\nIt\u2019s
          about knowing what they\u2019re supposed to do versus what they\u2019re
          actually doing.\n\nThe guidebook lays out timelines. Reviews. Access to
          property. How long you can be in here before someone has to look at your
          case again. How to file a grievance. What counts as \u2018protective custody\u2019
          and what they owe you while you\u2019re in it.\n\nWithout it, everything
          feels arbitrary. Like whatever happens to you just\u2026 happens.\n\nWith
          it, at least you can say, \u2018No, that\u2019s not what your policy says.\u2019\n\nIt
          doesn\u2019t fix the system. It doesn\u2019t open the door.\n\nBut it gives
          you something solid to stand on in a place where most of the ground keeps
          shifting."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 29
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 29
        originDialogueID: 14
        destinationConversationID: 29
        destinationDialogueID: 27
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 1120
        y: 638
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 15
